  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Wildwood premiered at the BFI London Film Festival on October 11, 2026, and was released in the United States by Fathom Entertainment on October 23, 2026.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383842384:8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "The score soundtrack came out on October 23, 2026, with a new original song by The Decemberists, and a single was released on October 9.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383842384:27"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Directed by Travis Knight and written by Chris Butler, this 2026 American stop-motion animated epic fantasy is based on the 2011 novel by Colin Meloy and Carson Ellis.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383842384:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "The film stars Carey Mulligan, Peyton Elizabeth Lee, Jacob Tremblay and Richard E. Grant, with music by Dario Marianelli.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1383842384:starring",
        "wiki:box:1383842384:music"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "It was released on 11 October 2026 at the BFI and on 23 October 2026 in the United States, and Wikipedia records its box office as $53 million.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1383842384:released",
        "wiki:box:1383842384:box-office"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:43Z",
      "text": "Of the credited people, 13 have a birthplace on record, and 9 of them were born in the United States.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q15306031:P19",
        "wd:Q184805:P19",
        "wd:Q195691:P19",
        "wd:Q20965633:P19",
        "wd:Q219655:P19",
        "wd:Q232120:P19",
        "wd:Q30069887:P19",
        "wd:Q360399:P19",
        "wd:Q360531:P19",
        "wd:Q365915:P19",
        "wd:Q380856:P19",
        "wd:Q40064:P19",
        "wd:Q7836302:P19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:51Z",
      "text": "Some were born further afield: Jacob Tremblay in Vancouver, Canada, Carey Mulligan in City of Westminster, United Kingdom, and Dario Marianelli in Pisa, Italy.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q20965633:P19",
        "wd:Q219655:P19",
        "wd:Q360399:P19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:01:01Z",
      "text": "On 2 November 2026, 69,768 people read the English Wikipedia article, about 9× the usual daily count.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Wildwood_(film):2026-11-02",
        "views:en:Wildwood_(film):prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:01:07Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 10 languages, and after English, the most readers were in German, with 2,477.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Wildwood_(film):2026-11-02",
        "views:de:Wildwood_(Film):2026-11-02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:01:13Z",
      "text": "On the globe, each language glows where it is mainly spoken, brighter for more readers, and a language is not the same as a country.",
